	(text "Power entry.  Slot +5V reaches +5V through Q1 (P-FET, gate = VBUS): fully on without USB, off with USB\nplugged in, so USB never back-feeds the Apple.  USB VBUS reaches +5V through D5 (Schottky).\nU4 (AP2112K, fast start) makes +3V3 for everything: the RP2354B pads are 5 V tolerant only while\nIOVDD is up, and the LDO tracks the slot rail as it rises.  USB-C is for firmware updates (BOOTSEL)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
